Surok — Geotechnical Reasoning Agent
Copyright 2026 Sasha Sazonova

This repository contains documentation, agent persona files and a static
presentation. It does not bundle third-party software. The documents
reference open-source geotechnical packages (numpy, scipy, geoeq, pygef,
groundhog, xslope, pyslope, OpenSeesPy, gempy, geopandas, rasterio, pyproj,
pyvista, IfcOpenShell, geofound, geolysis, liquepy, pyStrata, python-ags4,
ezdxf) and Russian normative documents (СП, ГОСТ); all rights remain with
their respective authors. Normative document texts are not included.
